---
// Hero mockup: chat with a rail-booking approval card.
---

<div class="flex h-full flex-col gap-3 px-4 pt-14 pb-6 text-[12.5px] leading-snug">
  <div class="self-end max-w-[82%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-md bg-[#6d4aff] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-white">
    Get me to Paris on Friday, back Sunday evening
  </div>

  <div class="self-start max-w-[86%] text-white/85 px-1">
    The 09:01 Eurostar is fastest and still has good seats. I've held it for you:
  </div>

  <div class="glass-bright self-stretch rounded-2xl p-3.5">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
      <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wide text-white/60 uppercase">Eurostar · Standard</span>
      <span class="rounded-full bg-[#6d4aff]/30 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10.5px] font-semibold text-[#c9b8ff]">hold · 9:42</span>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-2.5 flex items-center justify-between font-semibold text-white">
      <div class="text-left">
        <div class="text-[17px]">09:01</div>
        <div class="text-[10.5px] font-medium text-white/55">London St Pancras</div>
      </div>
      <div class="px-2 text-white/40">→</div>
      <div class="text-right">
        <div class="text-[17px]">12:20</div>
        <div class="text-[10.5px] font-medium text-white/55">Paris Gare du Nord</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-2.5 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-white/10 pt-2.5">
      <span class="text-white/60">Return Sun 19:13 · £156 total</span>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-3 flex gap-2">
      <span class="flex-1 rounded-full bg-white py-2 text-center font-semibold text-[#1b0b3d]">Approve &amp; pay</span>
      <span class="rounded-full border border-white/20 px-4 py-2 text-center text-white/70">Decline</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="self-start px-1 text-[10.5px] text-white/40">
    Osmos pays only after you approve · within your limits
  </div>
</div>
